{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">一個歐洲著名馬術劇場匯演，下周二起在啟德體藝館公演。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">54匹歐洲名駒，由歐洲乘搭波音747貨機抵港。該馬術劇場表演是首次在亞洲巡演，演出結合馬術、音樂、舞蹈及舞台劇，是馬會馬年系列活動的重點盛事之一。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CAVALLUNA-1730_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026OyYe5hAVEq1788517338.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.CAVALLUNA-1730_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">騎手將會展示「匈牙利站騎」，即是站在兩匹馬上，策騎多匹駿馬前行，以及飛騎特技及無韁馭馬等。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CAVALLUNA-1730_007.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026bTfaQK7ao01788517289.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.CAVALLUNA-1730_007.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CAVALLUNA-1730_003.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026JkcdvlftBD1788517270.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.CAVALLUNA-1730_003.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">團隊曾於超過30個歐洲城市巡演，觀眾人次達數百萬，今次來港，馬匹都會留在體藝館休息。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CAVALLUNA-1730_006.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026xux2Z0pSvO1788517309.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.CAVALLUNA-1730_006.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-04T10:38:30.111542+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":189,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}